OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSunny spells and showers today.
OL,6,FShowers heaviest and most frequent
OL,7,Facross the north of the UK. A rather
OL,8,Fcool and windy day for all, but very
OL,9,Fwindy across Scotland with severe
OL,10,Fgales across northern Scotland. Large
OL,11,Fwaves along the coasts.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FStaying windy across the
OL,14,Fnorthwest of the UK, with further
OL,15,Fshowers and perhaps some longer spells
OL,16,Fof rain too. Drier towards the
OL,17,Fsoutheast, with clear spells and winds
OL,18,Feasing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
