OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FShowers tending to become
OL,6,Fconfined to Scotland as high pressure
OL,7,Fbuilds from the south. Dry and bright
OL,8,Ffor most, with sunny spells and
OL,9,Flighter winds. Temperatures a little
OL,10,Fabove average.
